WEBVTT

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:31.202
It's around us in excess in abundance.

00:05:31.786 --> 00:05:32.912
It's CO2.

00:05:33.746 --> 00:05:34.914
Super cool.

00:05:35.456 --> 00:05:39.543
So then there's hybrids, not the cars,
geothermal hybrids.

00:05:39.585 --> 00:05:41.754
You take the best of both worlds, right?

00:05:41.796 --> 00:05:43.672
You get the increased surface area

00:05:43.714 --> 00:05:46.217
and heat that you get from
fracturing rock.

00:05:46.258 --> 00:05:48.719
You combine that
with a closed-loop well design

00:05:48.719 --> 00:05:51.305
so you can use that optimized fluid.

00:05:51.347 --> 00:05:54.642
The goal of hybrid systems
is to extract the most heat,

00:05:54.683 --> 00:05:56.394
minimize drilling costs.

00:05:56.936 --> 00:05:58.729
So that's what's happening right now.

00:05:58.729 --> 00:05:59.939
A lot of innovation.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.774
It's really, really cool.